{"type":"definition","type_name":"Definition","number":"1.2.2","title":"Box-Free Derivation","title_html":"Box-Free Derivation","html":"<p>Fix a list of rules, each given by schemas. A <strong>box-free\nderivation</strong> is a finite list of numbered lines <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"1, 2, \\dots, n\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2026\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, where <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"n \\ge 1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2265\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, each carrying one statement and\na justification, such that:</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\roman*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>the first lines, possibly none and possibly all, are\n<strong>premises</strong>, justified by nothing; a short horizontal rule\nis drawn under the last premise;</li>\n<li>every later line is justified by <strong>one</strong> rule of the\nlist, citing <strong>earlier</strong> lines, and it and the cited lines\nform an instance of a schema of that rule.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p>The <strong>premises</strong> of the derivation are its premise\nlines, and its <strong>conclusion</strong> is its last line.</p>","file":"ch01-connectives-and-derivations/02-derivations.html"}